  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nutritious meals for 50 hungry children in Soweto</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project serves 50 beneficiaries ranging in age from 3 - 18 years who come from the Emdeni township in Soweto. The children have been affected by HIV and AIDS &amp; TB. Some have been orphaned, some live with ill parents and some with Grandparents. No child should go hungry. Children cannot perform in school if they are hungry or take medicine. This project will supply 50 vulnerable children with daily meals and assist their families with sustenance farming and emotional support..</narrative>
  </description>
